msgstr "關閉"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1420
msgid "Spectrum"
msgstr "頻譜"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1421
msgid "Waveform"
msgstr "波形"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1616
msgid "Proxy"
msgstr "Proxy"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1618
msgid "Mode, host, port, username and password"
msgstr "模式、主機、連接埠、使用者名稱和密碼"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1621
msgid "Off, System, HTTP or SOCKS5 proxy for network requests."
msgstr "網路要求的 Proxy：關閉、系統、HTTP 或 SOCKS5。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1631
msgctxt "proxy"
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1634
msgid ""
"Off ignores environment variables. System uses them, and the OS proxy on "
"macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
"「關閉」會忽略環境變數。「系統」會使用環境變數，在 macOS 和 Windows 上還會使"
"用作業系統的 Proxy。"

