msgid "Always on top"
msgstr "最上層顯示"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1712
msgid "Show Winamp in taskbar"
msgstr "在工作列中顯示 Winamp"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1715
msgid "Mini player"
msgstr "迷你播放器"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1719
msgid ""
"Use classic Winamp .wsz skins. Press Ctrl+M or click the skin logo to "
"return. Drop a skin on either window to add it."
msgstr ""
"使用經典的 Winamp .wsz 面板。按 Ctrl+M 或按一下面板標誌即可返回。將面板拖放到"
"任一視窗即可新增。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1723
msgid ""
"Use classic Winamp .wsz skins. Press Cmd+Shift+M or click the skin logo to "
"return. Drop a skin on either window to add it."
msgstr ""
"使用經典的 Winamp .wsz 面板。按 Cmd+Shift+M 或按一下面板標誌即可返回。將面板"
"拖放到任一視窗即可新增。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1729
msgid "Skin"
msgstr "面板"

#. Translators: {folder} is the path of the skins folder.
#: src/ui/settings.rs:1733
#, rust-format
msgid "Installed skins are in {folder}. Find more at the Winamp Skin Museum."
msgstr "已安裝的面板位於 {folder}。可在 Winamp Skin Museum 找到更多面板。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1738 src/ui/winamp/mod.rs:711
msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1739
msgid "Whole-number scaling keeps skin pixels sharp."
msgstr "以整數倍縮放可讓面板像素保持清晰。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1744
msgid "Keep the Winamp window above everything else."
msgstr "讓 Winamp 視窗一律顯示在其他視窗之上。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1750 src/ui/winamp/mod.rs:734
msgid "Show in taskbar"
msgstr "在工作列中顯示"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1753
msgid ""
"Keep a taskbar button for the mini player. The tray icon stays available "
