msgstr "在工作列中保留迷你播放器的按鈕。隱藏後仍可使用系統匣圖示。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1758
msgid "Installed skins"
msgstr "已安裝的面板"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1771
msgid "Switch to it"
msgstr "切換至此面板"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1784
msgid "Skin Museum"
msgstr "Skin Museum"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1810
msgid "Random"
msgstr "隨機"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1849
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Now showing {skin}. Another one is picked each time the mini player opens."
msgstr "目前外觀：{skin}。每次開啟迷你播放器都會換一個。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1905
msgid "MilkDrop window"
msgstr "MilkDrop 視窗"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1913
msgid ""
"A projectM visualiser for local playback. Open it here, from the top bar, "
"with Ctrl+Shift+K, or from the mini player's V menu. Press ? or F1 for its "
"shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"用於本機播放的 projectM 視覺效果。可從這裡、頂端列、按 Ctrl+Shift+K 或透過迷"
"你播放器的 V 選單開啟。按 ? 或 F1 查看快捷鍵。"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:1917
msgid ""
"A projectM visualiser for local playback. Open it here, from the top bar, "
"with Cmd+Shift+K, or from the mini player's V menu. Press ? or F1 for its "
"shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"用於本機播放的 projectM 視覺效果。可從這裡、頂端列、按 Cmd+Shift+K 或透過迷你"
"播放器的 V 選單開啟。按 ? 或 F1 查看快捷鍵。"

