msgstr "用 Spotify Soloist 聆聽"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:40
msgid "Spotify's own player, with lossless support."
msgstr "Spotify 官方播放器，支援無損音訊。"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:43
msgid ""
"You'll need Spotify Premium, your personal Soloist key and one pairing in "
"Spotify. Spotifast handles the download and updates."
msgstr ""
"需要 Spotify Premium、你的個人 Soloist 金鑰，以及在 Spotify 中完成一次配對。"
"Spotifast 會負責下載和更新。"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:45
msgid "Set up Soloist"
msgstr "設定 Soloist"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:52
msgid "Start listening"
msgstr "開始聆聽"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:60
msgid ""
"For EQ, visualizers, local files and queue editing, use the built-in player. "
"You can switch later in Settings."
msgstr ""
"如需使用等化器、視覺化、本機檔案和佇列編輯，請選擇內建播放器。之後可以在設定"
"中切換。"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:62
msgid "Use the built-in player"
msgstr "使用內建播放器"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:82 src/ui/soloist.rs:215
msgid "Enabled on this computer"
msgstr "已在這部電腦上啟用"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:83 src/ui/soloist.rs:217
msgid "Updates automatically."
msgstr "自動更新。"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:87
msgid "Spotify's player, with lossless support. Requires Premium."
msgstr "Spotify 播放器，支援無損音訊。需要 Premium。"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:100
msgid ""
"Spotify has not published Soloist for this platform. The built-in player "
"remains available."
msgstr "Spotify 尚未發布適用於此平台的 Soloist。內建播放器仍可使用。"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:106 src/ui/soloist.rs:244
msgid "Turn off Soloist"
msgstr "關閉 Soloist"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:118
msgid "Sign in to Spotify before setting up Soloist."
msgstr "設定 Soloist 前，請先登入 Spotify。"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:132
msgid "1. Get your Soloist key from Spotify"
msgstr "1. 從 Spotify 取得 Soloist 金鑰"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:141
msgid ""
"Create a Soloist key in Spotify's developer dashboard. This is separate from "
"your Web API app's Client ID."
msgstr ""
"在 Spotify 開發者控制台中建立 Soloist 金鑰。它與你的 Web API 應用程式的 "
"Client ID 不同。"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:143
msgid ""
"Soloist makes its own Spotify connections. Spotifast's proxy settings do not "
"route its audio traffic."
msgstr ""
"Soloist 自行連線至 Spotify。Spotifast 的代理伺服器設定不適用於 Soloist 的音訊"
"流量。"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:149
msgid "Paste your personal Soloist key"
msgstr "貼上你的個人 Soloist 金鑰"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:156
msgid "Retry with saved key"
msgstr "使用已儲存的金鑰重試"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:158
msgid "2. Download and enable Soloist"
msgstr "2. 下載並啟用 Soloist"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:176
msgid "Enable with saved key"
msgstr "使用已儲存的金鑰啟用"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:184
msgid ""
"Downloads directly from Spotify and saves your key in the system credential "
"store. By enabling Soloist, you use Spotify's separate software under its "
"terms."
msgstr ""
"直接從 Spotify 下載，並將金鑰儲存在系統認證儲存區。啟用 Soloist 即表示你使用 "
"Spotify 的獨立軟體，並遵守其條款。"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:189
msgid "Starting Soloist…"
msgstr "正在啟動 Soloist…"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:193
msgid "Downloading Soloist from Spotify…"
msgstr "正在從 Spotify 下載 Soloist…"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:206
msgid "3. Pair once in Spotify"
msgstr "3. 在 Spotify 中配對一次"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:207
msgid ""
"Open Spotify on the same network, using the account signed in here. In the "
"device picker, choose:"
msgstr "在同一網路上開啟 Spotify，使用此處登入的帳號。在裝置清單中選擇："

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:209
msgid ""
"Spotifast will notice when pairing finishes. Future starts reconnect "
"automatically."
msgstr "Spotifast 會偵測到配對完成。日後啟動時會自動重新連線。"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:220
msgid "Confirming your Spotify account…"
msgstr "正在確認你的 Spotify 帳號…"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:221
msgid ""
"If this takes a while, make sure Spotify is signed in to the same account as "
"Spotifast, then select this device there."
msgstr ""
"如果等候較久，請確認 Spotify 與 Spotifast 登入的是同一個帳號，再於 Spotify 中"
"選取此裝置。"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:232
msgid "Update ready. It will install when Soloist is inactive."
msgstr "更新已就緒，將在 Soloist 處於非使用中狀態時安裝。"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:253
msgid "Details"
msgstr "詳細資訊"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:262
#, rust-format
msgid "Version {version} · expires {date}"
msgstr "版本 {version} · 到期日期 {date}"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:265
msgid ""
"Spotifast checks daily for a replacement during the last 30 days of each "
"build. Updates wait until Soloist is inactive."
msgstr ""
"在每個版本到期前的最後 30 天內，Spotifast 每天檢查是否有替代版本。更新會等到 "
"Soloist 處於非使用中狀態。"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:268
msgid ""
"Soloist uses your system audio output. Turn it off to use the built-in "
"player's EQ, visualizers, local files and queue editing."
msgstr ""
"Soloist 使用系統音訊輸出。關閉它即可使用內建播放器的等化器、視覺效果、本機檔"
"案和佇列編輯功能。"

#: src/ui/soloist.rs:269
msgid ""
"Spotify chooses playback quality. Soloist does not report the delivered "
"audio format yet."
msgstr "Spotify 決定播放音質。Soloist 尚未回報實際接收的音訊格式。"

